### FLEARN Questions API Test Suite
### Use REST Client extension in VS Code to run these tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8099
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### 1. Health Check
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ============================================
### 2. Get All Subjects
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/subjects

### ============================================
### 3. Get All Question Types
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/types

### ============================================
### 4. Get All Questions (No Filter)
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questions

### ============================================
### 5. Get Questions with Filters
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questions?subject_id=1&difficulty=2&limit=5

### ============================================
### 6. Get Questions by Type
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questions?type=multiple_choice

### ============================================
### 7. Create Multiple Choice Question
### Requires Authentication
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subject_id": 1,
  "type_name": "multiple_choice",
  "difficulty": 2,
  "points": 10,
  "time_limit": 60,
  "content": {
    "question_text": "What is the capital of France?",
    "question_html": "<p>What is the capital of <strong>France</strong>?</p>",
    "options": [
      { "id": "a", "text": "London", "is_correct": false },
      { "id": "b", "text": "Paris", "is_correct": true },
      { "id": "c", "text": "Berlin", "is_correct": false },
      { "id": "d", "text": "Madrid", "is_correct": false }
    ],
    "explanation": "Paris is the capital and most populous city of France.",
    "media": []
  }
}

### ============================================
### 8. Create True/False Question
### Requires Authentication
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subject_id": 2,
  "type_name": "true_false",
  "difficulty": 1,
  "points": 5,
  "time_limit": 30,
  "content": {
    "question_text": "The Earth is flat.",
    "options": [
      { "id": "true", "text": "True", "is_correct": false },
      { "id": "false", "text": "False", "is_correct": true }
    ],
    "explanation": "The Earth is an oblate spheroid, not flat."
  }
}

### ============================================
### 9. Create Multi-Select Question
### Requires Authentication
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subject_id": 1,
  "type_name": "multi_select",
  "difficulty": 3,
  "points": 15,
  "time_limit": 90,
  "content": {
    "question_text": "Which of the following are even numbers? (Select all that apply)",
    "options": [
      { "id": "a", "text": "2", "is_correct": true },
      { "id": "b", "text": "3", "is_correct": false },
      { "id": "c", "text": "4", "is_correct": true },
      { "id": "d", "text": "7", "is_correct": false },
      { "id": "e", "text": "8", "is_correct": true },
      { "id": "f", "text": "9", "is_correct": false }
    ],
    "partial_credit": true,
    "correct_count": 3,
    "explanation": "Even numbers are divisible by 2. The even numbers are 2, 4, and 8."
  }
}

### ============================================
### 10. Create Fill Blank Question
### Requires Authentication
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subject_id": 3,
  "type_name": "fill_blank",
  "difficulty": 2,
  "points": 10,
  "time_limit": 45,
  "content": {
    "question_text": "The process by which plants make their own food is called _____.",
    "blanks": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "position": 0,
        "correct_answers": ["photosynthesis", "Photosynthesis"],
        "case_sensitive": false
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Photosynthesis is the process by which plants convert light energy into chemical energy."
  }
}

### ============================================
### 11. Create Essay Question
### Requires Authentication
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subject_id": 2,
  "type_name": "essay",
  "difficulty": 4,
  "points": 20,
  "time_limit": 600,
  "content": {
    "question_text": "Describe the water cycle and explain the role of evaporation, condensation, and precipitation.",
    "word_limit": { "min": 100, "max": 300 },
    "grading_rubric": [
      { "criterion": "Understanding of water cycle", "points": 7 },
      { "criterion": "Explanation of evaporation", "points": 4 },
      { "criterion": "Explanation of condensation", "points": 4 },
      { "criterion": "Explanation of precipitation", "points": 5 }
    ],
    "keywords": ["evaporation", "condensation", "precipitation", "water", "cycle"],
    "sample_answer": "The water cycle is a continuous process...",
    "requires_manual_grading": true
  }
}

### ============================================
### 12. Create Matching Question
### Requires Authentication
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subject_id": 4,
  "type_name": "matching",
  "difficulty": 3,
  "points": 12,
  "time_limit": 120,
  "content": {
    "question_text": "Match each element with its chemical symbol:",
    "left_items": [
      { "id": "1", "text": "Hydrogen" },
      { "id": "2", "text": "Oxygen" },
      { "id": "3", "text": "Carbon" },
      { "id": "4", "text": "Nitrogen" }
    ],
    "right_items": [
      { "id": "a", "text": "C" },
      { "id": "b", "text": "H" },
      { "id": "c", "text": "N" },
      { "id": "d", "text": "O" }
    ],
    "correct_matches": [
      { "left": "1", "right": "b" },
      { "left": "2", "right": "d" },
      { "left": "3", "right": "a" },
      { "left": "4", "right": "c" }
    ],
    "explanation": "These are the chemical symbols from the periodic table."
  }
}

### ============================================
### 13. Get Single Question (Replace :id with actual ID)
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_QUESTION_ID

### ============================================
### 14. Validate Multiple Choice Answer (CORRECT)
### Replace :id with actual question ID
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_QUESTION_ID/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": "b",
  "time_taken": 25
}

### ============================================
### 15. Validate Multiple Choice Answer (WRONG)
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_QUESTION_ID/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": "a",
  "time_taken": 50
}

### ============================================
### 16. Validate Multiple Choice Answer (Fast - with bonus)
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_QUESTION_ID/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": "b",
  "time_taken": 15
}

### ============================================
### 17. Validate Multi-Select Answer (ALL CORRECT)
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_MULTISELECT_ID/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": ["a", "c", "e"],
  "time_taken": 60
}

### ============================================
### 18. Validate Multi-Select Answer (PARTIAL)
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_MULTISELECT_ID/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": ["a", "c"],
  "time_taken": 45
}

### ============================================
### 19. Validate Fill Blank Answer (CORRECT)
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_FILLBLANK_ID/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": "photosynthesis",
  "time_taken": 30
}

### ============================================
### 20. Validate Matching Answer (ALL CORRECT)
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_MATCHING_ID/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": [
    { "left": "1", "right": "b" },
    { "left": "2", "right": "d" },
    { "left": "3", "right": "a" },
    { "left": "4", "right": "c" }
  ],
  "time_taken": 90
}

### ============================================
### 21. Validate Essay Answer
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_ESSAY_ID/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": "The water cycle is a continuous process where water evaporates from oceans and land, condenses into clouds, and falls back to Earth as precipitation. This cycle is essential for distributing fresh water across the planet.",
  "time_taken": 300
}

### ============================================
### 22. Update Question
### Requires Authentication
### ============================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_QUESTION_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "difficulty": 3,
  "points": 15,
  "time_limit": 90
}

### ============================================
### 23. Update Question Content
### Requires Authentication
### ============================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_QUESTION_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": {
    "question_text": "Updated: What is the capital of France?",
    "explanation": "Paris is the capital city of France and its most populous city."
  }
}

### ============================================
### 24. Delete Question (Soft Delete)
### Requires Authentication
### ============================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_QUESTION_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### Test Error Cases
### ============================================

### 25. Create Question with Missing Fields (Should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subject_id": 1,
  "type_name": "multiple_choice"
}

### 26. Create Multiple Choice with No Correct Answer (Should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subject_id": 1,
  "type_name": "multiple_choice",
  "difficulty": 2,
  "content": {
    "question_text": "Test question?",
    "options": [
      { "id": "a", "text": "Option 1", "is_correct": false },
      { "id": "b", "text": "Option 2", "is_correct": false }
    ]
  }
}

### 27. Get Non-existent Question (Should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 28. Validate Answer without Answer Field (Should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions/REPLACE_WITH_QUESTION_ID/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time_taken": 30
}
